"Netdeck could not check whether the running configuration is saved. Changes that were never saved are lost if the router restarts with its saved configuration." = "Netdeck no pudo comprobar si la configuración en ejecución está guardada. Los cambios que nunca se guardaron se pierden si el router se reinicia con su configuración guardada.";
